{"version":1,"content":"<p>11月是行山的好時節，藝人陳凱琳(Grace)再次踏上征途，向飛鵝山進發。</p><p>Grace於社交平台上載了行山照片，見當天風和日麗，清風送爽，雖然她不是首次挑戰飛鵝山，可是因為今次另闢蹊徑，改走一條人迹罕至、被茂密植物覆蓋的荒蕪山坡，不時要撥草攀</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-21T13:23:57.044379+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":121,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-21T13:01:55+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-21T13:17:17.460778+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-21T13:17:17.460778+00:00","content_hash":"3d492d23a355e6acd94da72e22125a90a0dcdb6ebcbaafdcc4a5b60a6cc60675","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}